DECLARE `Reading of Article 15(3) where the entity has not complied with Article 15(2)` IS ONE OF
    `no duty arises under Article 15(3)`
    `the Commissioner may refuse to deregister`
    `the Commissioner must refuse to deregister`
    `the Law states no rule for that case`

-- F6.2: Article 16(1) (may, after a prior notice) beside Article 16(2) (must, where the entity no longer exists).
