DECLARE `Reading of how Article 16(2) stands beside Article 16(1)` IS ONE OF
    `Article 16(2) governs alone and the duty arises on satisfaction with no prior notice`
    `Article 16(2) follows the procedure of Article 16(1) and the duty arises only after the prior notice has run its time`

